WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.706
Read the question carefully, list the needed quantities, choose operations in order,

00:00:04.706 --> 00:00:05.832
then check units.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:15.323
First add 14 and 39, then multiply the result by 2. The answer is 106. (14 plus 39)

00:00:15.323 --> 00:00:17.239
times 2 equals 106.

00:00:18.117 --> 00:00:23.783
A classroom for a school fundraiser has 35 blue counters and 26 red counters in each

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:28.741
box. There are 3 boxes. How many counters altogether? Pause the video and think.

00:00:29.617 --> 00:00:36.728
A classroom for a school fundraiser has 35 blue counters and 26 red counters in each

00:00:36.728 --> 00:00:43.839
box. There are 3 boxes. How many counters altogether? The answer is 183. (35 plus 26)

00:00:43.839 --> 00:00:45.617
times 3 equals 183.
